<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>ZXUI.Svg</PackageId>
    <Product>ZXUI Svg</Product>
    <Title>ZXUI.Svg</Title>
    <Version>1.0.0</Version>
    <Description>Lightweight SVG icon support for Avalonia. Three components: SvgSource (IImage), SvgIcon (TemplatedControl with Foreground / Background / StrokeWidth), and the {z:Svg uri} markup extension. Pairs with ZXUI.Svg.Core for parsing + SkiaSharp rendering. Zero external dependencies beyond Avalonia (11+) and ZXUI.Svg.Core. Target framework: net10.0.</Description>
    <PackageTags>avalonia;svg;icon;zxui;vector;controls</PackageTags>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageReleaseNotes><![CDATA[
首发版 —— Avalonia 轻量矢量图标库，基于 Avalonia.Media.StreamGeometry + System.Xml.Linq 自实现。

提供三件套：
- SvgSource : IImage —— SVG 数据 + 解析缓存，能塞到 Image.Source / ImageBrush
- SvgIcon : TemplatedControl —— 真实控件，进 Content 区，叠加 Foreground / Background / StrokeWidth 视觉覆盖
- {z:Svg uri} 标记扩展 —— XAML 简写

支持 SVG 子集：polyline / polygon / line + viewBox + stroke 属性。ZXUI 设计标准：尺寸 mini 12 / small 16 / regular 20 / large 24，描边 light 1 / regular 2 / bold 3。
    ]]></PackageReleaseNotes>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Avalonia" Version="12.1.*" />
    <PackageReference Include="Avalonia.Skia" Version="12.1.*" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\ZXUI.Svg.Core\ZXUI.Svg.Core.csproj" PrivateAssets="none" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)/README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="README.md" />
    <None Include="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)/LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="LICENSE" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
